#. module: social_push_notifications
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:social_push_notifications.field_website_visitor_push_subscription__keys
msgid ""
"It refer to browser keys used by the notification: \n"
"- p256dh: It's the subscription public key generated by the browser. The "
"browser will \n"
"          keep the private key secret and use it for decrypting the payload\n"
"- auth: The auth value should be treated as a secret and not shared outside "
"of Odoo"
msgstr ""
"Se refiere a las claves del navegador que usa la notificación: \n"
"- p256dh: es la clave pública de suscripción que genera el navegador. El "
"navegador mantendrá \n"
"          la clave privada en secreto y la usará para descifrar la carga "
"útil.\n"
"- auth: el valor auth debe tratarse como secreto y no se debe compartir "
"fuera de Odoo."

